# 🧭 **COMPRESSED vs UNCOMPRESSED SAVE‑STATE EXAMPLE (v1.0)**  
*A8 Governance · Compression Validation · Runtime Persistence*

This example demonstrates how your compression rules transform a save‑state.

---

